{"lyrics":"[00:00.00] [Instrumental Intro]\n[Chorus]\n[00:12.58] Got a new nine, bet it leave your mouth wide\n[00:14.96] Leave you hogtied, burning on a campfire\n[00:17.76] Before I leave the crib, I pray to God I won't die\n[00:20.32] I know it's hard to kill me, but I know they gonna try\n[00:23.70] You's a pussy boy, yeah, you a feline\n[00:26.60] Get your own business and get out mine\n[00:29.48] Had to kill a witness, ain't doing no time\n[00:32.42] Watch them niggas around you, they playing both sides\n[Verse 1]\n[00:35.30] Boy, your gang ain't your gang and your homies not your homies\n[00:38.24] Run it up, get that sack, but do that shit right by your lonely\n[00:41.12] Chopper hit him with a force like I'm Obi-Wan Kenobi\n[00:43.90] Don't need no court to use my torch, I've been shooting like I'm Kobe\n[00:46.90] I don't need nobody, I just need your body, ay, ay, ay\n[00:49.62] I'm gonna catch a body if you fuck with my money, ay, ay, ay\n[00:52.76] Mixing the narcotics turn me to a zombie\n[00:55.06] Hate when a nigga harami\n[00:56.06] Pull up on a nigga, no talking\n[00:57.16] Leave a nigga looking no faucet, yeah\n[00:58.48] Stand up to the opps, never back down\n[00:59.84] He get beat with the belt like it's smackdown\n[01:01.46] Studio just like trap house\n[01:02.94] Crack cocaine my track out\n[01:04.46] Up late night like owls\n[01:05.88] Backwood Smoke, no White House\n[01:07.40] I got the lean on me right now, got a gun with a beam on me right now\n[Chorus]\n[01:10.64] Got a new nine, bet it leave your mouth wide\n[01:13.14] Leave you hogtied, burning on a campfire\n[01:15.94] Before I leave the crib, I pray to God I won't die\n[01:18.90] I know it's hard to kill me, but I know they gonna try\n[01:21.88] You's a pussy boy, yeah, you a feline\n[01:24.78] Get your own business and get out mine\n[01:27.68] Had to kill a witness, ain't doing no time\n[01:30.58] Watch them niggas around you, they playing both sides\n[Verse 2]\n[01:33.16] Thinking about it every day, I'm pouring up the mud\n[01:36.04] Get her off my mind when I be taking all these drugs\n[01:38.98] She ain't on my phone no more, I'm talking to my plug\n[01:42.26] Yeah, yeah\n[01:44.76] Thinking about it every day, I'm pouring up the mud\n[01:47.68] Get her off my mind when I be rolling off the drugs\n[01:50.64] I took two Perc 30s, I'ma do what it does\n[01:53.62] I be with them niggas booling, I'm not a cuz\n[01:56.46] All my niggas going hard, going in\n[01:59.32] Never lose, I told you that I win-win\n[02:01.86] Me and G Money in the cut, counting them Benjis\n[02:04.78] Full clip in my bag, leave it empty\n[02:07.18] Ay, your nigga mad I got a Gucci purse\n[02:10.60] What's up in here probably get him murked and put him in a hearse, you hear me?\n[02:13.96] Uh, I've been going crazy, what's it worth?\n[02:16.32] You talking down to me, my nigga probably put you in the dirt, you feel me?\n[02:19.64] Uh, yeah\n[Verse 3]\n[02:20.78] Tote that glizzy even though I am a rockstar\n[02:23.64] Choke around my neck, I'm dancing on a cop car\n[02:26.60] Pull that camera out, your bitch is now my porn star\n[02:29.52] Fuck her off the Xannies, I done took it too far\n[02:31.86] I've been Gucci while these niggas up at Walmart\n[02:35.02] Uh, hit a home run, boy, I knock it out that ballpark\n[02:38.36] Uh, iron on my hip, they call a nigga Tony Stark\n[02:41.36] Uh, .223's up in the air, f'ning your bones apart, yeah\n[02:44.06] I've been going hard, yeah\n[02:45.50] Pull your bitch, I pull that trigger, then I pull your card, yeah\n[02:48.46] I'm in the water, swimming up in her, I feel like a shark, yeah\n[02:51.32] Two bitches at a time up on my yacht like Noah's Ark, yeah\n[Verse 4]\n[02:54.36] You don't want no smoke, these niggas jokes\n[02:56.48] I'm a rich nigga and all these other niggas broke\n[02:59.36] Murder what I did, but murder what the snitches wrote, (laughs)\n[03:01.88] Yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah, mmm\n[03:06.62] Like a Fac